463	    /**
464	     * The derived key used for duplicate detection: the SHA-256 hex digest over this
465	     * owner's normalised telephone, lower-cased email and the {@link #soundex(String)
466	     * Soundex} of its last name. Two owners are duplicates exactly when their whole
467	     * identity keys are equal, so because the telephone is part of the key, members of
468	     * the same household with different telephones have different keys. Derived (not
469	     * persisted); recomputed each call. See
470	     * {@link OwnerDerivations#identityKey(String, String, String)} for the exact format.
471	     *
472	     * @return the owner's identity key
473	     */
474	    @Transient
